{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary board game of galactic conquest comes to life on <strong>PC</strong>! Take your place among the stars in <i>Twilight Imperium Digital </i>- a faithful recreation of the iconic strategy game, now reimagined for digital play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/022c6eb401fc150d7764168e2f1845f7.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=270 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try\u00a0<strong>Space</strong> <strong>Combat Simulator</strong>, a standalone gamemode dedicated entirely to <strong>1v1 space battles</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Engage in <strong>1v1 space battles</strong> against AI or other players.<br>\u25cf\u00a0Choose from <strong>several factions</strong>\u00a0with unique abilities and units   <br>\u25cf <strong>Produce units and assemble fleets</strong> for combat.<br>\u25cf\u00a0Experience <strong>turn-based tactical encounters</strong>.<br>\u25cf Use a <strong>curated selection of cards and mechanics</strong> from the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/79e42552dcc1df41dba36f554841c926.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/79e42552dcc1df41dba36f554841c926.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/79e42552dcc1df41dba36f554841c926.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Twilight Imperium Digital</strong> to follow development and future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/5a0cbc107789dc5559646df4059ae25c.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f5a20dc8f3d97ecfc4ccdecad1d2eb73.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command one of 17 unique factions fighting for control of the galaxy through diplomacy, warfare, trade, and cunning political maneuvering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/85b285f3e9a6b0ae82b8f2a7245a094f.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/85b285f3e9a6b0ae82b8f2a7245a094f.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/85b285f3e9a6b0ae82b8f2a7245a094f.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a veteran looking for faster matches or a newcomer seeking a guided introduction, the digital edition brings the entire <i>Twilight Imperium</i> experience to your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/d41c32fa11e8db016b90c456cd6650ad.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your faction to victory in a universe where every decision counts. Will you dominate through raw military might, control the Galactic Council with persuasive politics, or outmaneuver rivals with secret objectives and clever deals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f70b7fea93155570e65633a9437e94d0.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f70b7fea93155570e65633a9437e94d0.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f70b7fea93155570e65633a9437e94d0.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>17 unique factions</strong>, each with asymmetric powers and playstyles. <br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Massive replayability</strong> with randomized galaxy maps and objectives. <br>\u25cf <strong>Full implementation of 4th Edition rules</strong>\u00a0including trade, game phases and components.  <br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Multiplayer and solo modes</strong>: challenge friends or AI across full-length matches. <br>\u25cf <strong>Synchronous</strong> and <strong>asynchronous</strong> multiplayer options, letting you play in real time or at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/acbad65649481844bd0dff17fff61220.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No setup time! No cleanup! Just deep, immersive 4X gameplay with beautiful visuals, intuitive UI, and official rule enforcement. With automated systems handling the math and logistics, you can focus on the strategy that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/8779fcdd5b0937b478989c4252bcdc08.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/8779fcdd5b0937b478989c4252bcdc08.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/8779fcdd5b0937b478989c4252bcdc08.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Dynamic visuals</strong> bring the galaxy to life.<br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Smart interface</strong> designed for newcomers and veterans alike.<br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Interactive tutorials</strong> and tooltips to guide your journey.<br>\u25cf<strong>\u00a0Animated 3D tactical battles </strong>bring even more excitement to every skirmish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f84212b2f8d6daab6405df354db927d3.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate</strong>, <strong>betray</strong>, <strong>ally</strong>, and <strong>conquer</strong>. Every session of <i>Twilight Imperium Digital</i> is a rich story shaped by your choices and rivalries. Will you sit upon the throne of Mecatol Rex, or fade into the void of forgotten empires?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/4d5048bb06a7a8c7442b7fbec1845543.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/4d5048bb06a7a8c7442b7fbec1845543.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/4d5048bb06a7a8c7442b7fbec1845543.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/a9a99b75a6ec619eb010ef4c228afb92.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669430?t=1771941696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/39bc558e21574054b0f27b154f3591ab1b469039/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771941696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/5ed46079edf6fee69bf5c9f6c6c4689edd2dc8d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771941696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/5ed46079edf6fee69bf5c9f6c6c4689edd2dc8d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771941696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4381660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary board game of galactic conquest comes to life on <strong>PC</strong>! Take your place among the stars in <i>Twilight Imperium Digital </i>- a faithful recreation of the iconic strategy game, now reimagined for digital play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/022c6eb401fc150d7764168e2f1845f7.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=270 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try\u00a0<strong>Space</strong> <strong>Combat Simulator</strong>, a standalone gamemode dedicated entirely to <strong>1v1 space battles</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Engage in <strong>1v1 space battles</strong> against AI or other players.<br>\u25cf\u00a0Choose from <strong>several factions</strong>\u00a0with unique abilities and units   <br>\u25cf <strong>Produce units and assemble fleets</strong> for combat.<br>\u25cf\u00a0Experience <strong>turn-based tactical encounters</strong>.<br>\u25cf Use a <strong>curated selection of cards and mechanics</strong> from the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/79e42552dcc1df41dba36f554841c926.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/79e42552dcc1df41dba36f554841c926.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/79e42552dcc1df41dba36f554841c926.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Twilight Imperium Digital</strong> to follow development and future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/5a0cbc107789dc5559646df4059ae25c.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f5a20dc8f3d97ecfc4ccdecad1d2eb73.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command one of 17 unique factions fighting for control of the galaxy through diplomacy, warfare, trade, and cunning political maneuvering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/85b285f3e9a6b0ae82b8f2a7245a094f.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/85b285f3e9a6b0ae82b8f2a7245a094f.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/85b285f3e9a6b0ae82b8f2a7245a094f.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a veteran looking for faster matches or a newcomer seeking a guided introduction, the digital edition brings the entire <i>Twilight Imperium</i> experience to your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/d41c32fa11e8db016b90c456cd6650ad.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your faction to victory in a universe where every decision counts. Will you dominate through raw military might, control the Galactic Council with persuasive politics, or outmaneuver rivals with secret objectives and clever deals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f70b7fea93155570e65633a9437e94d0.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f70b7fea93155570e65633a9437e94d0.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f70b7fea93155570e65633a9437e94d0.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>17 unique factions</strong>, each with asymmetric powers and playstyles. <br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Massive replayability</strong> with randomized galaxy maps and objectives. <br>\u25cf <strong>Full implementation of 4th Edition rules</strong>\u00a0including trade, game phases and components.  <br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Multiplayer and solo modes</strong>: challenge friends or AI across full-length matches. <br>\u25cf <strong>Synchronous</strong> and <strong>asynchronous</strong> multiplayer options, letting you play in real time or at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/acbad65649481844bd0dff17fff61220.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No setup time! No cleanup! Just deep, immersive 4X gameplay with beautiful visuals, intuitive UI, and official rule enforcement. With automated systems handling the math and logistics, you can focus on the strategy that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/8779fcdd5b0937b478989c4252bcdc08.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/8779fcdd5b0937b478989c4252bcdc08.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/8779fcdd5b0937b478989c4252bcdc08.mp4?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Dynamic visuals</strong> bring the galaxy to life.<br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Smart interface</strong> designed for newcomers and veterans alike.<br>\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Interactive tutorials</strong> and tooltips to guide your journey.<br>\u25cf<strong>\u00a0Animated 3D tactical battles </strong>bring even more excitement to every skirmish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/f84212b2f8d6daab6405df354db927d3.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate</strong>, <strong>betray</strong>, <strong>ally</strong>, and <strong>conquer</strong>. Every session of <i>Twilight Imperium Digital</i> is a rich story shaped by your choices and rivalries. Will you sit upon the throne of Mecatol Rex, or fade into the void of forgotten empires?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/4d5048bb06a7a8c7442b7fbec1845543.poster.avif?t=1771941696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/4d5048bb06a7a8c7442b7fbec1845543.webm?t=1771941696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669430/extras/4d5048bb06a7a8c7442